2026-07-27T10:40:38.4394052Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:40:38.4394662Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:40:38.4395095Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:40:38.4395552Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:40:38.4396172Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:40:38.4396954Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
